Bundled assets

- assets/avatar.png is original agent artwork by the copyright holder and is
  covered by the MIT license above. It is instance-specific: replace it with
  your own agent's image per deployment (see https://github.com/caty-ai/meetmate/blob/main/docs/setup-guide.md).
- assets/fillers/ ships manifest.json only. The audio takes are NOT included:
  they were synthesised for one specific voice and are not redistributable.
  manifest.json lists the phrase for each filler slot so you can record or
  synthesise your own set; clone the repository if you need to seed fillers;
  the npm tarball does not include the seeder.
